  "style": "Funk",
  "instructions": "An E9 at the seventh fret with the hand moving in sixteenths, down on every beat. Strike on the pattern, scratch the muted strings on the x by releasing the fretting hand's pressure, and miss the strings on the rest. The scratch is the groove: keep it short and dead.",
